{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Note: This game is still in early stages of development. Everything you see here is slated to change.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bibidi Bibidi!</i><strong> </strong>is a wizardcore <strong>roguelike</strong> <strong>deckbuilder</strong> with a spellcasting system that enables you to create powerful, wacky spells with unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/4efb75f1b80f9f278ba12deccd60aebb.poster.avif?t=1773130763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/4efb75f1b80f9f278ba12deccd60aebb.webm?t=1773130763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/4efb75f1b80f9f278ba12deccd60aebb.mp4?t=1773130763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine incantation cards strategically to adapt to every situation. Will you <strong>zap</strong> your foes into oblivion, <strong>enchant</strong> yourself for flexible future turns, or <strong>draw</strong> more cards for a barrage of spells?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/d40ab257cfe728d6cda2f8c8dff1d708.poster.avif?t=1773130763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/d40ab257cfe728d6cda2f8c8dff1d708.webm?t=1773130763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/d40ab257cfe728d6cda2f8c8dff1d708.mp4?t=1773130763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Familiar combat with a strategic twist.</strong><br>Easy to learn for new players as well as fans of the genre, while plenty of surprises keep it fresh. Select 1 of 3 effects for each card and mix 'n match to create the ideal spell to get you out of a pickle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft the perfect wizarding build.\u00a0</strong><br>Experiment with a myriad of incantation cards, sigils, and spellbooks to become the ultimate magic wielder. Rewards, events, and the shopkeeper all offer potential expansions to your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a dark but whimsical subterranean</strong> <strong>mystery.</strong><br>Entombed deep within the earth, underneath the towering spires your brethren once called home, through twisting tunnels and maddening monsters, lies hidden your deepest wish<i>.</i> Fight your way through the mountain and uncover the secret origins of magic itself. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted dungeon synth playlist.\u00a0</strong><br>The underground halls of the mountain reverberate with nostalgic sounds of 90s fantasy-themed synthesizer ambient. We cooked it ourselves!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to the end? Will you find out what happened to your brethren? Are you the last wizard? <strong><i>Bibidi Bibidi!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/c36e20b309029cc99b6c662d8b85f4e6.poster.avif?t=1773130763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/c36e20b309029cc99b6c662d8b85f4e6.webm?t=1773130763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/c36e20b309029cc99b6c662d8b85f4e6.mp4?t=1773130763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540660?t=1773130763","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/33230baac8c4bfaa23eb31fc2f3a78718a5f60f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773130763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/c3dda93ee26a847425582fce26d8cef44d6f7664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773130763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/c3dda93ee26a847425582fce26d8cef44d6f7664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773130763","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Note: This game is still in early stages of development. Everything you see here is slated to change.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bibidi Bibidi!</i><strong> </strong>is a wizardcore <strong>roguelike</strong> <strong>deckbuilder</strong> with a spellcasting system that enables you to create powerful, wacky spells with unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/4efb75f1b80f9f278ba12deccd60aebb.poster.avif?t=1773130763\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/4efb75f1b80f9f278ba12deccd60aebb.webm?t=1773130763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540660/extras/4efb75f1b80f9f278ba12deccd60aebb.mp4?t=1773130763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine incantation cards strategi